<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―It was the summer vacation of my first year of elementary school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The days were long, and we kept on playing and playing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Every day was fun, and being able to be together made us happy―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Always, always, we would play until the stars came out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, one time―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夕焼け.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "蝶がひらひらと舞う的なBGM.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\蝶々\青蝶々.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "960" "C" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n300\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n300\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, look! A pretty </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ちょうちょ">butterfly</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It really is!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A summer evening. A single <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ちょう">butterfly</STYLE> was fluttering gracefully before our eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And just then―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\蝶々\赤蝶々.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "960" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n3\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n100\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n3\r\n100\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n100\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh! Another pretty butterfly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Let's catch them, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> and I chased after the two butterflies.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> kept getting farther and farther away from me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wait up, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, hurry, hurry!"</STYLE><PG>
It was the hour when the summer night sky was about to rise in the east.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ran desperately along a path where I could hardly see my feet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Haah... haah... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">whoa!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\down1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> was all I'd been watching as I ran. Maybe that was why I tripped over something and fell.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\夕焼け.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Uugh... it hurts... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">uugh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Waaah! It hurts..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you okay, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> came running over right away.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"There, pain, pain, fly awaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> gently laid her hand on my scrape.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're okay now, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uugh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> took my hand and pulled me to my feet.<PG>
It hadn't hurt all that much, but I bawled because I wanted the attention of <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>, who'd gone on ahead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> probably knew that too, since all she did was lay her hand on my scrape.<PG>
In front of us, sunflowers taller than we were.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We lined up our heads like the sunflowers too, and looked up at the summer evening sky.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the east, stars were already beginning to twinkle here and there.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\蝶々\青蝶々.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "960" "C" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\蝶々\赤蝶々逆.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "-330" "C" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n700\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n3\r\n300\r\n4000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "4000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n3\r\n700\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n3\r\n300\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
Then the two butterflies we'd been chasing fluttered around us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\茜蝶々.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
And they landed one on each of <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>'s hands and rested their wings.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\茜差し出す.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "-900" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物2\r\n3\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Here, a butterfly for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Pretty... Hello, cute little butterfly!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The two butterflies didn't seem <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE> at all, and rested calmly right in front of us.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Do you think these little butterflies are a family?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Maybe they're friends?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\蝶々\青蝶々.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "R" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\蝶々\赤蝶々逆.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "540" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n200\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n200\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n-400\r\n3000\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n-400\r\n3000\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n-400\r\n0\r\nINC\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "アイテム2" "4" "-400" "0" "INC" "WAIT"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The two butterflies flew up together into the dim, wide sky.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Bye-byyye, little butterflies! Take care!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Those little butterflies are close, just like us!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Night fell completely, and Motoki-cho was covered by the starry summer sky.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\最後の声から\星空.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"The stars are pretty today too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, did you know? In a big city like Tokyo, you can't see a sky like this, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"How come?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The city's so bright you can't see the stars in the sky, apparently."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm. Then I'll stay in Motoki-cho forever!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Me too!"</STYLE><PG>
It was a small promise.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Both <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> and I were born in Motoki-cho, raised in Motoki-cho, and would live our lives in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
May I always, always be able to look at this starry sky together with <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>.<PG>
This is my best friend since the day I was born: <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She's very dear to me, someone I could never replace.<PG>
Even after we grew up, that didn't change.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We aren't related by blood, but by now you could call us family.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> is a big sister, older than me by only a few months.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
My mom died giving birth to me, and my dad died of an illness too, around when I started high school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Through all of it, <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> was there for me, the same as ever.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was one day, a few months after Dad's funeral...
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "77" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像2" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "80" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "イエローカメラ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"So this is Primavera. It looks expensive..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> had picked this cafe as our meeting place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'd said she would at least treat me to a drink, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
for a high schooler like me, it felt like a bit much...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sei_ge_cowbell01.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\喫茶店中1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, over here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a fancy place like this, <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> was relaxing without the least bit of nerves.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, sorry! Did I keep you waiting...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hurried over to <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> in a fluster.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Is this okay? A place this expensive..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Now that a new cafe's opened, we have to check it out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There's no other place this nice in Motoki-cho."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-you're right! I'll do my best so I can be like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was always trying to catch up to <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even in high school, <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE>, cool as she was, still turned a kind, warm gaze on me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone like <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> was popular with boys, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, by the way, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, how's your boyfriend from the technical high school? Going well?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you mean? Yeah, it's going well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But for all his looks... he's too much of a kid, maybe..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"U-uh-huh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> was popular, but until now she'd never had a boyfriend.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The same <STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE> had decided to go out with him, so maybe this was just her covering up her embarrassment?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Lucky you. I want a boyfriend too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I think you've got good raw material... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Shouldn't you work a little more on being independent, or rather, on being able to take the plunge?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know I'm the clingy type myself, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you're always such a big baby, so even when you like someone, you can't go for it, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uugh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I... I really do depend on </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too much, don't I..."</STYLE><PG>
